{"name": "One and Done", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"490\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/dde6b5ea2084c9c7d198ed974b81f10c.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=\"814\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/dde6b5ea2084c9c7d198ed974b81f10c.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/dde6b5ea2084c9c7d198ed974b81f10c.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There is no turning back! [ONE &amp; DONE]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Consumption &amp; Switching</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a weapon\u2019s gauge is fully depleted, it automatically switches to the next one.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unpredictable weapon changes can turn the tide in your favor \u2014 or against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/a41051b3ac7f3ba7f8ef3801b39e334f.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/a41051b3ac7f3ba7f8ef3801b39e334f.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/a41051b3ac7f3ba7f8ef3801b39e334f.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A 7-Floor Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the more complex and powerful the bosses become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must learn enemy patterns and adapt. Of course, that takes time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"950\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e330205605a0483e745bbffb3e0c73a3.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e330205605a0483e745bbffb3e0c73a3.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e330205605a0483e745bbffb3e0c73a3.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are you ready to give up?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were <i>this close</i>. One more hit\u2026 just one more strike, and it would\u2019ve been over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The maze is always waiting for your next challenge.\ud83d\ude0e</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/972410ae1cea170073a697d8e8a24bdc.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/972410ae1cea170073a697d8e8a24bdc.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/972410ae1cea170073a697d8e8a24bdc.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "One and Done must use four different weapons to navigate the labyrinth and battle monsters on each floor. Use the constantly changing weapons wisely to engage in strategic combat.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/356026a3c117d7a158497741f26473c7ef87005e/header.jpg?t=1769075817", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Casual", "Action Roguelike", "Platformer", "2D", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "MYMEStudio", "publishers": "MYMEStudio", "release_date": "Jan 21, 2026", "price": "$6.99", "appid": "3424220", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/cAVNFxdDYXM", "first_seen": 1747267200.0, "review_rank": 1663}